; E-VO's own modules come first; the E 3.3a modules (MUI and friends) are added after them.
assign EVO: XFer:EVO
path EVO:Bin add
assign EMODULES: EVO:modules
assign EMODULES: XFer:Amiga-E/Modules ADD
echo "E-VO is set up"
